The files in patients/ are trimmed extracts of synthetic patient records generated by
Synthea(TM), an open-source synthetic patient generator by The MITRE Corporation
(https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea), taken from the Synthea sample data
(https://synthetichealth.github.io/synthea-sample-data/).

Synthea is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).
The records describe fictional people. They contain no real patient data.

Trimming was done with scripts/import_synthea.py: only the Patient, Condition,
laboratory Observation and one DiagnosticReport resource per patient were kept, and
fields the demo does not use were removed.
